Package: netmapperv2
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Netmapper Contributors <netmapper@example.org>
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC_VERSION@)
Conflicts: netmapperv1
Replaces: netmapperv1
Description: independent bounded TCP and UDP network scanner
 Netmapper resolves IPv4 and IPv6 targets and provides bounded TCP/UDP scans,
 optional IPv4 SYN scanning and traceroute, a sandboxed NSE subset, JSON output,
 and target-oriented port profiles.